{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_title", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3c4b67767153147370ccf785a98ac8bbf9983b83e7097a4c75fe7b4f824f3d67", "ja": "なあ、恵美。\nこの前の公演のブログなんだけど……。", "zh": "欸，惠美。\n关于之前公演的部落格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "c9b754ec6edfd55986956dd23960617d7f4ecdd4cb763421806d6ce5ab3333ca", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、読んでくれたんだ！\nねぇねぇ、どうだった？　面白かった？？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，你看了啊！\n欸欸，你觉得怎么样？有趣吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c613f43e800c5ddad72888f9bb9d22bebfb50db66fb779f22332a9f19bba9fa9", "ja": "面白かったかと聞かれれば、面白かったけど……\n今回のライブでたこ焼きってそんなに重要だったか？", "zh": "要我回答的话，是有趣没错，不过……\n章鱼烧在这次的演唱会有这么重要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "cfa9925a8b3c6cf8e95ec9d4090253d7be7673a6292d499340ce0c1a701bd65e", "ja": "あれ、違ったっけ？", "zh": "咦？没有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "087d940606cba2c0bc3f2bc63e766f4f283575ab71d093f4b250200282d4963e", "ja": "ちょっと待った～！", "zh": "给我等一下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1005_p", "source_sha256": "582271c0125ac866581bc1721c78c105f6137d9d6e5027f70a87d24784c6145d", "ja": "奈緒？　今、どこから……。", "zh": "奈绪？你是从哪蹦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "37ced67bdb30a046355f1eb4e4f121449324e250194bb12cbd7f4fe8c2b1c794", "ja": "たこ焼きやろ！？　めっちゃ重要に決まってるやん！\nアイドルとは、たこ焼きみたいなもんやー！", "zh": "在讲章鱼烧不是吗！？那当然重要啦！\n偶像就像章鱼烧一样啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1007_p", "source_sha256": "066f3b5fd07a1b5cfa9ddcf5aa60e6bebe1bb1a8d87e9a7af7347339d925289e", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか？", "zh": "是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "571662e3efb693a45610d39e20d3a3488841607e6877f8db752bef02b45d9298", "ja": "せやで！　たこ焼きは美味しいし、手軽に食べれるし、\nパーティーでも定番中の定番、美味しい万能料理や！", "zh": "没错！章鱼烧不只好吃，吃起来也很方便，\n在派对中更是必备的基本菜色，是美味的万能料理啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "de25183e637318ba5d859b257bac5f6c952c66cb8d247a065dad5383cfc82b8d", "ja": "あ！　{$P$}さん、\n美味しいたこ焼きの作り方、教えましょか？", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生，\n要不要我教你怎么做好吃的章鱼烧啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8a1406041d10a6d8f3aaa555c74ec6327b75d1fb4413909969f5bf85714eb3ef", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。\nでも今は、そういう話をしてるわけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你的好意。\n但我现在不是在讲这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "2db60b79713520e3c7b988f6de58d1266f42e2e2cefcd3e61a1a76b0c9874144", "ja": "奈緒さん、恵美さん！\n見～っけ！", "zh": "奈绪、惠美！\n找～到你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "787356117cfdc7b2f42d67a70973b2fe70bd88b66192cc6964d6697535b5a2a9", "ja": "もうすぐ……レッスン……です。", "zh": "练习……要……开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "0b482113859775acefc305288dbe2cd0b8f0c03ac7dfe32c057dcdfb33b14fa3", "ja": "あっ、そうだった！\n早く準備しなきゃっ！", "zh": "啊，对吼！\n得快点做准备才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "09ea9acae2d0b55ada6046ebb4e1d62b0749e3039ee57fb07b90ffb772a6d8f0", "ja": "あちゃ～、忘れてたわ。{$P$}さん、\nたこ焼きの作り方はまた後でな！", "zh": "哎呀～我都忘了。{$P$}先生，\n等等再教你做章鱼烧吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1b62c42b2519193ce36afe260f855fbd6c3c553ade8df149b95a27a218c2d442", "ja": "あ、ああ、わかった。", "zh": "呃，好，我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "74879c15214b432991f5c3df79a5f52f4533f47d3471aa6e679b46f82c5f8501", "ja": "{$P$}さん。どうしておふたりに、\nレッスンの時間だと教えてあげなかったんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你为什么不提醒她们练习的时间要到了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bee4221b4faa573d44230d4327b4d409242fcd5cd234d9019e0fa7c6b111379e", "ja": "え？　いや、たこ焼きの話をしていて……。", "zh": "咦？呃，因为还在讲章鱼烧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "f1a478bf40b1f6fbe05086040963e15002c65c4c2295a52382fabe8c637f8aa2", "ja": "たこ焼き？\n……意味がわからないんですけど。", "zh": "章鱼烧？\n……真是莫名其妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "5cde979d8c946b0331a2bdbae155681b896bcc10b451cdf09f3fb22a031dd4d0", "ja": "よっしゃ。準備完了や～！", "zh": "好啊，准备完成啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "66e9f81cfff43cd2416bc84c66379732d0577165f43d98d29cf4d98ef27c75c3", "ja": "可奈、志保、杏奈！\n早く来ないと、始めちゃうよ～！", "zh": "可奈、志保、杏奈！\n你们再不来就要开始了喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "99413873b8af63a46f938f1ac531efac68fab574bbc575e8a9a2f5f536afcb8d", "ja": "わわっ！？\n恵美さん、奈緒さん！　待ってくださ～い！", "zh": "哇哇！？\n惠美、奈绪！等我们一下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "3c0c059346ad3b1ce39343d6e1c97fadc299b1b93ef8755f8ff65cebc662c126", "ja": "それじゃ、失礼します。", "zh": "那我们先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1023_p", "source_sha256": "980925d486d31f409073f9a3dc35b13cf744ee1389b8cd0280e98cd82ba59d5b", "ja": "ああ。\n……みんな、今日も頑張ろう！", "zh": "好。\n……各位，今天也要加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fb70aa487e4acba14dba5afbb95c88957e1e021b6f907a17c827066318eddd5b", "ja": "（親睦会で、たこ焼きパーティーをしたせいかな。\nみんなの絆が、より深まったような……）", "zh": "（或许是因为用章鱼烧开亲睦派对的关系，\n感觉大家的情谊又更深厚了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_016_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b2ca09f575ad00058608097a9c5ca871dac1311069116d5686d629e4a0355548", "ja": "（アイドルは、たこ焼きみたいなもの……これからも、\nみんなの色んな新しい味を引き出していこう！）", "zh": "（偶像就有如章鱼烧一般……今后我也要继续\n将大家各式各样的新滋味激发出来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
